  "title": "print: Use FTREPR_JSON for the ek output mode",
  "description": "Use FTREPR_JSON instead of FTREPR_DISPLAY for the -T ek mode,\nas -T json already uses. Right now it's only different from\nFTREPR_DISPLAY in a few places, all of which ek_write_field_value\nalready treats as special cases.\n\nEver since commit 480111c0f466a50cb97a929db1615e1858b9a87a\nFT_ABSOLUTE_TIME fields generate ISO 8601 output for FTREPR_JSON,\nso we can remove the special case for that field type from\nek_write_field_value without affecting the resulting output.",
